L1: Effects of antioxidant supplementation on oxidative stress balance in young footballers- a randomized double-blind trial
L2: Journal of the International Society of Sports Nutrition (2021)
L3: Błażej Stankiewicz, Mirosława Cieślicka, Sławomir Kujawski, Elżbieta Piskorska, Tomasz Kowalik, Justyna Korycka, Anna Skarpańska-Stejnborn
